ATTRIBUTION

This project's web design references (71 brands) are based on
VoltAgent/awesome-design-md (https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-design-md),
licensed under MIT.

iOS design references (22 apps) draw inspiration from
Meliwat/awesome-ios-design-md (https://github.com/Meliwat/awesome-ios-design-md)
and general knowledge of those apps' published iOS designs.

The single-file HTML demos and design system reference sections in this
